    "norm": "Tests {@link StringSubstitutor} variable replacement when a template uses an empty variable name together with a default value, e.g. {@code ${:-animal}}. <p>Because the variable name is empty (and therefore never present in the lookup map), the substitutor must fall back to the supplied default value. The expectation is verified across every {@code replace(...)} / {@code replaceIn(...)} input overload to confirm consistent behaviour.</p>"
